      "description": "<p><strong>Version B - Description</strong></p><p>B Series is a softer and cleaner refinement compared to A Series.<br />It focuses on smoother shading, reduced harsh contrast, and more controlled color transitions while preserving structure and detail clarity.</p><p><strong>Highlights:</strong></p><p>\u2022 softer lighting response<br />\u2022 cleaner gradients and skin/fur blending<br />\u2022 reduced noise in shadows<br />\u2022 more natural highlight placement<br />\u2022 improved overall balance in mid-tones</p><p>B Series works well as a standalone model for polished, smooth results. It is also suitable for merging if you want to soften harder bases, reduce contrast intensity, or introduce cleaner rendering into existing blends.</p><p><em>Designed for creators who prefer controlled softness without losing definition.</em></p>",
